 "scope": "Recorded proposal activation on captured live input only, not host execution or strength. 120 boards of live Deity Online Culture games of 2026-11-10/11 (Kristina of Sweden, then Pericles of Greece), each the run's events.jsonl cut at frame 0 of a turn before t130 whose first state frame shows a hostile land shooter of a rival at war within two tiles of a city of ours: every such board with a Field Cannon (37, 27 of them civvis-20261110T234227Z t105-t123), then boards with a Crossbowman. Both arms run one frozen civvis_orders --resumed built from the branch at 5e804d52c1 with the run's own requested genome plus siege-at-the-walls-dies-first and city-strike-takes-the-gun; the on arm adds --with every-shooter-at-the-walls. Orders differ on 38/120: blows (units and cities) on a shooter within two of a city of ours 111 -> 148, on a Field Cannon 12 -> 23, city strikes on such a shooter 65 -> 91 (26 boards more, none fewer), city strikes in all 145 -> 145; units in a Siege task force while a shooter stands at our walls 83 -> 34.",
